   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The passive in Präteritum: wurde and wurden",
     "texto": [
      "It is formed by conjugating the auxiliary **werden** in the Präteritum (**wurde** for singular, **wurden** for plural) with the **Partizip II** at the end of the sentence:",
      "1. Singular: **Der Serverausfall wurde in der Nacht behoben** (the server outage was fixed during the night).",
      "2. Plural: **Alle Dateien wurden rechtzeitig gespeichert** (all the files were saved on time).",
      "3. Style: In formal texts, news, work reports and technical manuals, the passive in the Präteritum is much more common than the passive in Perfekt (**ist ... worden**)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
